Show in conversation: Checked
Output Rendering: Text

2. Customer Names, Period 1 Revenue, Period 2 Revenue, Drop Amount, Drop Percentage

Show in conversation: Unchecked (will show via LWC)

3. Period 1 Label, Period 2 Label

Show in conversation: Unchecked

